{
  "comment:purpose": "The manifest. Adding a domain is one entry here, no code. `domain` / `docShape` / `queryShape` are REPORT metadata only — they never reach the ingest profile, whose vocabulary is frozen in tools/dp-gnosis/src/config.ts.",
  "datasets": [
    {
      "id": "nfcorpus",
      "format": "beir-zip",
      "qrels": "test",
      "source": "https://public.ukp.informatik.tu-darmstadt.de/thakur/BEIR/datasets/nfcorpus.zip",
      "domain": "biomedical",
      "docShape": "short-abstract",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "scifact",
      "format": "beir-local",
      "qrels": "test",
      "source": "../../docs/benchmarks/2026-08-14-external-suite/data/scifact",
      "domain": "scientific-claims",
      "docShape": "abstract",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "arguana",
      "format": "beir-zip",
      "qrels": "test",
      "source": "https://public.ukp.informatik.tu-darmstadt.de/thakur/BEIR/datasets/arguana.zip",
      "domain": "argumentation",
      "docShape": "argument",
      "queryShape": "long-form",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bright-biology",
      "format": "bright",
      "split": "biology",
      "granularity": "long",
      "domain": "biology",
      "docShape": "long-web-page",
      "atomMaxChars": 4000,
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "comment": "The same 103 biology queries as bright-biology, scored against the GOLD PASSAGES instead of the whole pages. A passage is ~387 chars, so one passage is essentially one atom and document-level scoring here IS block-level scoring — this is the block-ranking measurement. Its score MUST NOT be read as the cost of chunking relative to bright-biology: the candidate set is 57359 passages against 524 pages, so the two numbers measure different-difficulty tasks. To isolate chunking, vary atomMaxChars on ONE entry and compare across runs.",
      "id": "bright-biology-passages",
      "format": "bright",
      "split": "biology",
      "granularity": "passage",
      "domain": "biology",
      "docShape": "gold-passage",
      "atomMaxChars": 4000,
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
